This is an independent Linux-first program. The game message formats it reads were
worked out by others, and its code was written with their work as reference:

  - Pet Tracker by 0Fox2Give (https://github.com/0Fox2Give/PetTracker), GPL-3.0-only:
    collection, soul, rank, appearance, hit and merchant message layouts, the pet
    catalog and the creature/merchant/acquisition data tables in data/.
  - Aion-DPS-Meter by SkeeveAN / SkeeveTV (https://github.com/SkeeveAN/Aion-DPS-Meter),
    MIT: position, zone, movement and effect layouts, map calibration, map tiles and
    spawn data.
  - A2Tools-DPS-Meter by taengu (https://github.com/taengu/A2Tools-DPS-Meter), GPL-3.0:
    the KDE window-rule approach for overlays above fullscreen games (no code copied).

The GPL grant covers this project's code. It does not cover game artwork, names or
